  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往亚诺曼城中央医院(116.134)与护士苏珊娜(25.8)对话，选“是”交出1组【生命力回复药(500)】获得【宝库的钥匙】。",
      "type": "per-member-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆每名队员都需交出1组【生命力回复药(500)】",
      "type": "party-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.与受伤的男子(28.7)对话，获得【娜蕾希亚的藏宝图】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.前往阿凯鲁法村夏姆吉诊所(117.155)与夏姆吉医生(27.7)对话，获得【特制的药水】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "4.双击【特制的药水】，选“是”交出【娜蕾希亚的藏宝图】、【特制的药水】获得【浸湿的藏宝图】。",
      "type": "combined-use",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "5.返回亚诺曼城出南门至德威特岛(227.475)处翠格墓园，由游侠职业带队调查被移动过的墓碑(25.16)，选“是”进入地下水脉入口，通过蓝色传送石(21.42)进入地下水脉。",
      "type": "career-led-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆地下水脉为随机迷宫，共10层；魔物为Lv.44~54海盗",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "6.通过随机迷宫抵达地下宫殿，四个方向分别为四种属性之领域，需由封印师职业带队进入。",
      "type": "career-led-domain",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆四种属性之领域均为固定1层地图，固定遇到2只Lv.50魔物，战斗结束后随机追加一场同种类魔物战斗；若追加战斗出现3只，则有1只为Lv1；战斗胜利后随机掉落【四种属性之结晶】，亦可通过Lv.4或以上巧取技能获取",
      "type": "domain-rules",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆每名队员都需要收集四种属性结晶各10个",
      "type": "per-member-collection",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆四种属性之领域情况：",
      "type": "domain-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "名称位置魔物掉落物",
      "type": "table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "地之领域门卫（39.15）绿烟地之结晶",
      "type": "domain-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "火之领域门卫（11.15）雏龙火之结晶",
      "type": "domain-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "风之领域门卫（11.26）狂奔鸟风之结晶",
      "type": "domain-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "水之领域门卫（39.26）堕天使水之结晶",
      "type": "domain-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "7.持有【地之结晶】、【火之结晶】、【风之结晶】、【水之结晶】各10个与门卫(26.11)对话，交出【四种属性结晶】单人被传送至娜蕾希亚的宝库。",
      "type": "multi-item-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "8.与对应的NPC对话，交出【宝库的钥匙】、【浸湿的藏宝图】根据职业获得【奖品】（均可交易），任务完结。",
      "type": "career-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆职业对应NPC：",
      "type": "career-map-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "职业NPC奖品",
      "type": "table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "游侠娜蕾希亚（16.6）娜蕾希雅的口琴",
      "type": "career-reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "封印师比斯利（18.6）魔界风水盘",
      "type": "career-reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "其他职业爱说明的汉克（14.6）乐于助人的奖章",
      "type": "career-reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆【娜蕾希亚的口琴】：Lv.1乐器、耐久300；攻击+50、必杀+5；装备后使用窃盗（巧取）技能可对目标造成伤害",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆【魔界风水盘】：双击后获得称号“魔界风水师”；拥有“魔界风水师”称号（无论设定与否），且拥有相应魔物图鉴时，战斗中会显示相对应魔物属性",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "◆【乐于助人的奖章】：Lv.8级护身符、耐久100；攻击+40、必杀+15、反击+15、命中+15、闪躲+15；装备后获得称号“乐善好施之人”",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
